],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-a282e2442d4509dd1b4f"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-a282e2442d4509dd1b4f","source_order":[22,75,7],"order":4503},{"id":"huanchen-e-p181","title":"何进吊祠谥寔文范先生","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-28163d79e28590ee5f49","label":"裴注·《先贤行状》","text":"何进吊祠谥寔文范先生","evidence":["huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0051","role":"大将军、遣属吊祠","evidence":["huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1"]},{"person":"wgc-p0027","role":"谥曰文范先生、与纪高名并著而谌又配之世号三君、豫州百姓皆图画寔纪谌之形象","evidence":["huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1","source_order":[22,76,9],"order":4504},{"id":"huanchen-e-p191","title":"时人语陈氏四世公惭卿卿惭长","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-7776b43e0fa92acf02ef","label":"裴注·《博物记》","text":"时人语陈氏四世公惭卿卿惭长","evidence":["huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0027","role":"太丘长、四世于汉魏二朝并有重名而其德渐渐小减","evidence":["huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0053","role":"鸿胪","evidence":["huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"司空","evidence":["huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0046","role":"四世之末","evidence":["huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378","source_order":[22,309,9],"order":4560}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0027","name":"陈寔","evidence":["wgc-q0035","huanchen-q-95c1548bc8c53035de90","huanchen-q-f91d814c4105e4eeaaed","huanchen-q-a282e2442d4509dd1b4f","huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1","huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378","yuanzhang-q-0d22c803e6c58ab1b140","zhonghua-q-45b3c998d6fd20ad5d28"],"aliases":[],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o045-wgc-p0027","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及陈寔","evidence":["wgc-q0035"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-5743486375d0a2b9abc1","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-32c7a162eab5c88262a5","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军何进遣属吊祠，谥曰‘文范先生’。于时，寔、纪高名并著，而谌又配之，世号曰‘三君’。每宰府辟命，率皆同时；羔雁成群，丞掾交至。豫州百姓皆图画寔、纪、谌之形象","attribution":"裴注·《先贤行状》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0d45e04a406cc866b6e8","start":9,"end":89},{"id":"huanchen-q-95c1548bc8c53035de90","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9e42ff751a4e66ed8063","layer":"pei","quote":"灵帝崩，何进辅政，引用天下名士；征寔，欲以为参军，以老病，遂不屈节","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0d45e04a406cc866b6e8","start":61,"end":94},{"id":"huanchen-q-a282e2442d4509dd1b4f","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-ff1a2650beca7390fed8","layer":"pei","quote":"寔亡，天下致吊，会其葬者三万人，制缞麻者以百数","attribution":"裴注·《傅子》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0d45e04a406cc866b6e8","start":7,"end":30},{"id":"huanchen-q-e97a2c217665a0f1a65e","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9e42ff751a4e66ed8063","layer":"pei","quote":"寔为太丘长。遭党锢，隐居荆山，远近宗师之","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0d45e04a406cc866b6e8","start":40,"end":60},{"id":"huanchen-q-f778bae986dc5c201378","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-88a2303b1f9d35240a80","layer":"pei","quote":"太丘长陈寔，寔子鸿胪纪，纪子司空群，群子泰四世，于汉、魏二朝并有重名，而其德渐渐小减。时人为其语曰：‘公惭卿，卿惭长","attribution":"裴注·《博物记》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":308,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0bbc954a34e821268698","start":9,"end":67},{"id":"huanchen-q-f91d814c4105e4eeaaed","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9e42ff751a4e66ed8063","layer":"pei","quote":"寔之亡也，司空荀爽、太仆令韩融并制缌麻，执子孙礼；四方至者，车数千乘。自太原郭奉等，无不造门","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0d45e04a406cc866b6e8","start":132,"end":178},{"id":"wgc-q0035","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-80b838a103a1e5853a53","layer":"original","quote":"邓艾字士载，义阳棘阳人也〖1〗。少孤〖2〗，太祖破荆州，徙汝南，为农民养犊。年十二，随母至颍川。读故太丘长陈寔碑文〖3〗，言“文为世范，行为士则”；艾遂自名范，字士则。后宗族有与同者，故改焉。为都尉学士〖4〗，以口吃，不得作干佐〖5〗，为稻田守丛草吏。同郡吏父怜其家贫，资给甚厚，艾初不称谢〖6〗。每见高山大泽，辄规度指画军营处所，时人多笑焉。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-0d22c803e6c58ab1b140","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-abe7b500f4f4124ac69f","layer":"original","quote":"俱游学于异国〖3〗，并敬善陈仲弓","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":349,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":88},{"id":"zhonghua-q-45b3c998d6fd20ad5d28","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-44da995dbfb926b18a91","layer":"pei","quote":"会辟公府，临辞，太守问：‘谁可代君？’皓曰：‘明府欲必得其人，西门亭长可用。’寔曰：‘钟君似不察人为意，不知何独识我？’","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-a8c8d898dd67d8b0a6c1","start":76,"end":136},{"id":"zhonghua-q-8d5ceded576c523be7f2","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-8dc73a900dbd0ce1cb7a","layer":"pei","quote":"歆与北海邴原、管宁，俱游学。三人相善，时人号三人为‘一龙’：歆为龙头，原为龙腹，宁为龙尾。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5cff6c48e8e36da8ac0b","start":10,"end":56}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
